cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "ChronoVec: A Versioned Vector Index with Snapshot Isolation"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: "Michael"
    family-names: "Rottoli"
    website: "https://github.com/mchl-labs/chronovec"
repository-code: "https://github.com/mchl-labs/chronovec"
abstract: >-
  ChronoVec is a versioned approximate-nearest-neighbour index for collections
  that change over time. Snapshot-isolated queries read a consistent
  point-in-time view while writes continue concurrently. MVCC version intervals
  support historical retrieval, and bounded reclamation physically removes
  expired versions incrementally without requiring a full index rebuild.
keywords:
  - approximate nearest neighbour
  - vector search
  - multiversion concurrency control
  - streaming index
  - agent memory
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-09-07"
